WHAT IS NOT HERE
----------------

Art assets — icons, stickers, profile decoration, wallpapers — are not part of
this repository. Their licences permit use inside the application but not
redistribution as files. A build from this repository runs; some decoration
will be empty. This is expected, not a defect.

